        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e82d4acb-9ca6-45ba-b8ca-72b8c9fc75a4).Image",
        "Description": "47, this new contract is your spiciest one yet. Janus&apos; Original 5 gathered for a meeting with one of the Washingtons. These five are some of the most corrupt CEOs in the business.The Global Elite that seeks to control the masses in any way they can muster. All for the profit of it, to make as much money as possible. Lets cleanse this corruption that&apos;s blighting our world. Our client wants five unique methods for each. Any disguises work. Are you ready to make the world a moderately better place?",
